{"id":"658859","name":"黄瓜炒牛肉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658859/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"2个"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"菜椒","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉用盐、酱油、蚝油、胡椒粉、淀粉、花生油，腌制入味。","img":"images/658859/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"小黄瓜。","img":"images/658859/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去皮后切成四分。","img":"images/658859/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"内瓤带籽容易出水，影响口感，切去。","img":"images/658859/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再斜刀切厚片。","img":"images/658859/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"农家菜椒，很脆带微微辣，口感特好。","img":"images/658859/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"菜椒切成块。","img":"images/658859/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再切点姜丝，配菜准备就绪。","img":"images/658859/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用酱油、蚝油、淀粉和小半碗水调一个芡汁。","img":"images/658859/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅热油，倒入黄瓜翻炒。","img":"images/658859/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"黄瓜炒2分钟后放入菜椒，加适量的盐翻炒入味。","img":"images/658859/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炒至断生盛出备用。","img":"images/658859/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中再次热油，放入姜丝。","img":"images/658859/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入牛肉。","img":"images/658859/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"炒至变色。","img":"images/658859/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒入黄瓜翻炒。","img":"images/658859/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"最后倒入芡汁。","img":"images/658859/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"大火收汁，出锅。","img":"images/658859/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658859/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}